  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Ezekiel 7 and the Permanent Efficacy of Grace** (1 other source): The setlist includes this track, alongside The Best Ever Death Metal Band in Denton [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Mess Inside**: back after 47 archived shows (1449 days) [2]\n- **Source Decay**: back after 87 archived shows (2553 days) [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Steal Smoked Fish [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2012-10-27.aud** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 94 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This performance marked the final date of the first Transcendental Youth tour leg [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2012-10-27.aud**: taped by Thomas J Hartnett; transferred by Thomas J Hartnett; source: AUD>Zoom H2 recorder [1]. Also: Audio captured using Zoom H2 built-in microphones, then normalized and split in software [1]",
